731	pub struct MergedProps {
732	    /// Structural props the checker did not return, kept as the structural pass resolved them.
733	    pub kept: usize,
734	    /// Props the checker returned with a type it could not read (an `opaque` part: an import that does not resolve, a
735	    /// conditional type it left open), where the structural pass read the type in full. They keep the structural type,
736	    /// and their `degradedBy` also lists what the checker could not read.
