743	/// `declarations` win where both have a prop, and every structural prop the checker did not return stays as the
744	/// structural pass resolved it. `composes` replaces the entry's when the checker decided it, and an undecided one leaves
745	/// the structural `composes` ([`SemanticComponent::composes`]). A prop whose checker
746	/// type holds an `opaque` part, where the structural type holds none, keeps the structural type and adds the checker's
747	/// reasons to its `degradedBy`: the checker's answer there is a placeholder, and the structural one is not confirmed,
748	/// so it is marked. A type the checker only cut at a limit (`truncated`) is still its answer.
